			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 150400101,
					"content": "Here we are! So these must be the Foamflower Fields marked on the map.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400102,
					"content": "How come it's all so... green?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400103,
					"content": "Looks more like the Foamgrass Fields to me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150400104,
					"content": "Haha, it's not exactly what I imagined, either... But, that happens a lot!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400105,
					"content": "You mean false advertising? Yeah, when it's as bad as this, I usually file a complaint.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400106,
					"content": "Otherwise, my tour groups would file a complaint about me!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400107,
					"content": "No, no. Sorry, I should've been more specific.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400108,
					"content": "I mean more like... when reality doesn't live up to your expectations. That happens to me a lot.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400109,
					"content": "Oh, because of...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400110,
					"content": "Yeah. It's things like... climbing to the top of a mountain to see the view, only for a thick fog to roll in, you can barely see two feet in front of you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400111,
					"content": "Or gathering a bunch of firewood, only to find that a Pyro Slime snuck into your tent and set it all on fire...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400112,
					"content": "Oh, man. That's rough...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400113,
					"content": "Eh, I've gotten used to it by now. What adventure doesn't have a few bumps in the road?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400114,
					"content": "So, when you think about it, being able to enjoy this vast, open scenery, fresh air all around and no monsters in sight... I'd call that some pretty remarkable luck!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400115,
					"content": "What's even more remarkable is your ability to stay positive.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400116,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Asha"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400117,
					"content": "Oh, hey. I think the Asha found something. Pretty sure that's what that sound means.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400118,
					"content": "Geez, you can understand each other already? You two must be on the same wavelength or something!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400119,
					"content": "(You finish reading through.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400120
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150400120,
					"content": "Wow. The archiest of arch-enemies...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400121,
					"content": "If they were both people, maybe they could sit down and talk it out, but... But one's an Asha.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400122,
					"content": "C'mon, let's lend a hand! You ready, Asha?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400123,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Asha"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400124,
					"content": "Whoa, wait a second. How did we skip straight to action mode? Paimon doesn't even know what the game plan is.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400125,
					"content": "If you think about what the Asha love doing most, it must be dyeing things different colors, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400126,
					"content": "Yeah... And?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400127,
					"content": "And they're simple, pure-hearted beings.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400128,
					"content": "So, I doubt that Asha is here to cause trouble on purpose. The little guy probably just can't stand how dull and uninspiring all this plain grass looks.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400129,
					"content": "Yeah, and it's not like he could communicate any of that...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400130,
					"content": "Right! So if we help dye the meadow in a range of vibrant colors... Y'know, turn it into an actual flower field...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400131,
					"content": "...We can make that Asha happy and help out the staff member at the same time!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400132,
					"content": "Took the words right out of my mouth!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400133,
					"content": "Huh, a little conflict mediation... I like the way you think. You've got peacemaker potential.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400134,
					"content": "I'm in.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400135
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150400135,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Asha"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400136,
					"content": "Haha, stop... that tickles...! Oh, are we going somewhere? Is it far? I should let my friends know first—",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400137,
					"content": "Wait, where are you—",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400138
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400138,
					"content": "Hey, interpreter — did you catch any of that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400139,
					"content": "Maybe something needs to be moved? Or there's someone else nearby who needs our help even more...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400140
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400140,
					"content": "Okay, those two things sound completely unrelated! What are you even basing that off of?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400141
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400141,
					"content": "Well, the longer I watch Asha, the more their body language reminds me of saurians.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400142
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400142,
					"content": "Huh... You better not be lying to me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400143
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400143,
					"content": "No, I'm serious. In saurian body language, the same movement can often mean unrelated things. When my saurian mom raised her wings, it either meant \"come home early for dinner\" or \"you're in big trouble, kid.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400144
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400144,
					"content": "Wait, then how did you tell the difference?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400145
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400145,
					"content": "When I was little, I couldn't. Lemme tell you, I walked straight into a lot of punishments...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400146
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400146,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400147
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Asha"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400147,
					"content": "Wow, super sturdy, and fast too... So this is a Natlanese hot air balloon? It's awesome!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400148
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400148,
					"content": "Up here, everyone! Look! We're back!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				}
			]
		},
